  "beats": [
    {
      "title": "The shopper waits for everything",
      "narrative": "When a shopper presses Pay, Storefront sends POST /orders to Place order and waits for its answer. Place order loads and prices the basket, then makes four calls one after another and waits for each: Inventory service reserves the items, Payment provider charges the card, Orders DB saves the paid order, and Email provider takes the receipt. Only when the last of them answers does Place order confirm the order, so the shopper waits through all four calls in turn.",
