    {
      "title": "Stock is held while the card is charged",
      "narrative": "Place order reserves the items with Inventory service first, and charges the card only after the reservation answers. So the items are already set aside while Payment provider works on the charge: no other order can reserve them, and other shoppers no longer see them as available. However slow the payment is, the items stay held, unless Timeout guard cancels the order 10 seconds after it started and gives them back.",
