    {
      "title": "After 10 seconds, the order is undone",
      "narrative": "Place order starts Timeout guard for every order. If the order is still running after 10 seconds, the guard cancels it: it calls Release route to give the stock back, refunds a charge that went through, and the shopper sees an error page. That includes an order that is already paid and saved and is only waiting for the receipt email.",
